{
  "id": "orange-shirt-day",
  "content": {
    "description": [
      [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "In my third year, I helped design T-shirts for Orange Shirt Day, annual remembrance for Indigenous children forced into Canada’s residential schools, and for Survivors, families, and communities."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "On a tight timeline, we chose a tangram motif: each piece is necessary to the whole, echoing that Every Child Matters."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    ],
